Output demo-hooks.mp4

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1240
Set Height 940
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Shell "zsh"

Type "echo 'RedGreen · real Hermes plugin hooks · scripted agent'"
Enter
Sleep 900ms
Type "~/.hermes/hermes-agent-jobos/venv/bin/python demo_plugin.py"
Enter
Sleep 40s
